ocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（雨、雪、灰等）降落；下落；（霜）降；（霜）结；（阳光、月光）照射；倾泻；（幸运、不幸等）降临；来临；到来</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216365\">シカゴのあたりでは<ruby>雨<rp>(</rp><rt>あめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>降<rp>(</rp><rt>ふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っていました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">It was raining around Chicago.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">古い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ふるい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">老的；陈旧的；古老的；破旧的；长久的；由来已久的；历史悠久的；远古的；久远的；陈腐的；老套的；俗气的；过时的；落伍的；不合时宜的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"150654\"><ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>とき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>金<rp>(</rp><rt>かね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なりと<ruby>古<rp>(</rp><rt>ふる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いことわざにもある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">An old proverb says that time is money.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ふろ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">浴室；浴缸；洗澡；浴池；澡堂；公共浴场；漆器干燥室；（锄头、铲子等的）柄座；连接木制部分</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"158438\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>一日<rp>(</rp><rt>いちにち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>おきにふろに<ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>はい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ります。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I have a bath every other day.</span></div></li>"]